    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171380/extras/523baa891b82830e3b24105d94926bf3.avif?t=1751854455\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shenaniguns is a top-down, real time multiplayer shooter. Each time you spawn, you get 2-3 weapons (depending on the gamemode) to battle your friends! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With 100+ weapons such as\u00a0</strong>pistols, shotguns, snipers, grenades, turrets, portal guns, concentrated uranium, grappling hooks, 4&quot; tungsten cubes, industrially sized water guns, gasoline, pepper spray, gambling, galvanised square steel, drones, RPGs... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And much, much more, including special abilities and enchantments!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171380/extras/e32030d5150ca688ff418e9a67b16447.avif?t=1751854455\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gamemodes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free for all - Kill as many people as possible!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team deathmatch - Two even teams, red and blue!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Weapons - Self-explanatory</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the flag - Capture the other team's flag for extra points!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the point - Stand on points around the map to gain points for your team!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss battles - Such as Vectah! More coming soon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gun gaem - Your weapons you get are tied to your points</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHAOS - Explode when you die, move faster, 3 weapons, closer spawning, bigger fires, bigger battles, and a whole lot of nuclear waste</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171380/extras/9613dc7e0dc49a1408d695891beddccb.webp?t=1751854455\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shenaniguns is still being actively developed. You can test it out in the free demo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want to keep track of the game's development? Follow the store page, or join our Discord (link's on the right)</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171380/extras/523baa891b82830e3b24105d94926bf3.avif?t=1751854455\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shenaniguns is a top-down, real time multiplayer shooter. Each time you spawn, you get 2-3 weapons (depending on the gamemode) to battle your friends! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With 100+ weapons such as\u00a0</strong>pistols, shotguns, snipers, grenades, turrets, portal guns, concentrated uranium, grappling hooks, 4&quot; tungsten cubes, industrially sized water guns, gasoline, pepper spray, gambling, galvanised square steel, drones, RPGs... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And much, much more, including special abilities and enchantments!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171380/extras/e32030d5150ca688ff418e9a67b16447.avif?t=1751854455\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gamemodes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free for all - Kill as many people as possible!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team deathmatch - Two even teams, red and blue!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Weapons - Self-explanatory</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the flag - Capture the other team's flag for extra points!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the point - Stand on points around the map to gain points for your team!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss battles - Such as Vectah! More coming soon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gun gaem - Your weapons you get are tied to your points</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHAOS - Explode when you die, move faster, 3 weapons, closer spawning, bigger fires, bigger battles, and a whole lot of nuclear waste</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171380/extras/9613dc7e0dc49a1408d695891beddccb.webp?t=1751854455\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shenaniguns is still being actively developed. You can test it out in the free demo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want to keep track of the game's development? Follow the store page, or join our Discord (link's on the right)</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "A frantic top-down multiplayer shooter, with tons of unique weapons, guns and items in a randomiser. Get stupid weapons, whoever kills the most wins. No time to think!",
